title: "SOS MCP Services: Model Context Protocol Microservices Suite for Scientific and Bibliometric Intelligence"
abstract: "Monorepo suite of FastMCP microservices providing dual transport (stdio and HTTP/SSE) for AI agents and LLMs to interact with the UNAM scientific intelligence and bibliometric ecosystem."
